  "comments": [
    {
      "position": 0,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "に [ni] is a placement particle locating a point in time or space, で [de] indicates the domain in which the totality of an event takes place.",
      "html": "に [ni] is a placement particle locating a point in time or space, で [de] indicates the domain in which the totality of an event takes place.",
      "credits_raw": "dc",
      "content_sha256": "2f63be99abb9cf15585906994ed219288e385c97f4be5d35224991ab3be3e347",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 1,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "The particle に requires something physical, such as 東京に本店があります,whereas, で requires some activity, such as 東京で会合があります.",
      "html": "The particle に requires something physical, such as 東京に本店があります,whereas, で requires some activity, such as 東京で会合があります.",
      "credits_raw": "dc",
      "content_sha256": "b7f08186c1cce59739319cceeef1205dfaa886ed145ed04c47ec2c3a0f7ddf5b",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Is this correct?\ntimeでplaceに\n明日の朝で私が東京に打合せがありますので",
      "html": "Is this correct?<br/>timeでplaceに<br/>明日の朝で私が東京に打合せがありますので",
      "credits_raw": "dc",
      "content_sha256": "a9ddf1877e681881985609db1a5173e86367061dd07cd0fe7fb1980fa4a6dc3c",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 3,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "明日の朝に 私が 東京で 打ち合わせがありますので...",
      "html": "明日の朝に 私が 東京で 打ち合わせがありますので...",
      "credits_raw": "Miki",
      "content_sha256": "bec0798660a889ce029921c58e3bd411aac76dcd9d3b3df9931573c21700a87f",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 4,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "But I'm almost sure you can say 東京に会合があります as well. \nに is a placement particle locating a point in time or space, で indicates the domain in which the totality of an event takes place.",
      "html": "But I'm almost sure you can say 東京に会合があります as well. <br/>に is a placement particle locating a point in time or space, で indicates the domain in which the totality of an event takes place.",
      "credits_raw": "PaulO",
      "content_sha256": "d94b2996604d80f49218e94cc3a3e7bbcef19ab9617a7aed8a69da55bcee9522",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 5,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "tx paul, added as a note above.",
      "html": "tx paul, added as a note above.",
      "credits_raw": "dc",
      "content_sha256": "ae4667e71e301e1ff5e839fe629e9bc07322388b06ecb288d82dd95c55ebd24b",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 6,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "The particle に requires something physical, such as 東京に本店があります,whereas, で requires some activity, such as 東京で会合があります.",
      "html": "The particle に requires something physical, such as 東京に本店があります,whereas, で requires some activity, such as 東京で会合があります.",
      "credits_raw": "bamboo4",
      "content_sha256": "f25b0b1d12c575e0aeddc90ab54c9fb50a2597c7d62258fbe6c45adf396f0c77",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 7,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "I wouldn't say 東京に会合があります。 But I'd say 東京にて会合があります。",
      "html": "I wouldn't say 東京に会合があります。 But I'd say 東京にて会合があります。",
      "credits_raw": "Miki",
      "content_sha256": "182d919027fe6de96e7d97482e2f0da44d037ded977c612295a0d632647daffc",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 8,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "In the case of 東京で会合があります、basically にて and で are the same.",
      "html": "In the case of 東京で会合があります、basically にて and で are the same.",
      "credits_raw": "Miki",
      "content_sha256": "b6599371500ec6695e0ecf062dc2615d8ea371e004a3ea6e9fd0f306a89e6a50",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 9,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Miki, but basically にて and で are the same, right? Or is there a difference?",
      "html": "Miki, but basically にて and で are the same, right? Or is there a difference?",
      "credits_raw": "mhykx",
      "content_sha256": "e9981d05bdae88693d9d5455c5bd57aa10fdfd1a17335063609a2d659a2d49a2",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    }
